WEBVTT

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:53.560
Tranc Georb.

00:01:53.560 --> 00:01:55.150
King of Astria.

00:01:55.150 --> 00:01:57.610
The fastest way to get your name out there.

00:01:58.070 --> 00:02:00.030
A royal assassination, huh?

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:01.390
Don't worry.

00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:04.990
It's a tiny nation that depends
on its state-operated casinos.

00:02:05.510 --> 00:02:07.670
Even though you're just a novice assassin,

00:02:07.670 --> 00:02:10.700
it'll be more than enough to get your name out into the underground.

00:02:11.470 --> 00:02:14.050
Is the client on your side?

00:02:14.050 --> 00:02:15.650
Don't bother investigating.

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:18.880
At the very least, I can assure you it
won't become an international incident,

00:02:19.730 --> 00:02:21.890
Mr. Ishikawa.

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:37.360
Truly,

00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:41.360
the greatest treasures in the
world have been gathered here.

00:02:45.340 --> 00:02:49.350
Ice-ice-ice cream! Yes, yes, yes!

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:53.380
Bull-bull-bulldog! Go, go, go, get!

00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:57.630
Puddi-pudding parfait! Yeah, yeah, yeah!

00:02:57.630 --> 00:03:01.360
Everyone get together! We have so many friends!

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:04.220
Yay, yay, yay, yay!

00:03:04.220 --> 00:03:05.450
Marco!

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:09.350
How cool.

00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:11.870
Papa likes this print.

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:13.510
Yeah, samurai!

00:03:13.510 --> 00:03:17.520
Samu-samu-samu-samurai!

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:19.320
Samurai friend!

00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:21.920
That's not the song Mama made up.

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:23.600
I made it up just now.

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:28.290
Samu-samu-samurai friend!
Yeah, yeah, yeah, boom!

00:03:29.550 --> 00:03:30.500
Teacher!

00:03:31.030 --> 00:03:32.450
Now, now, children.

00:03:32.450 --> 00:03:35.040
Don't get in the way of your grandfather's work.

00:03:35.180 --> 00:03:37.100
Ms. Maria!

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:39.700
We're going home tomorrow.

00:03:39.700 --> 00:03:42.480
Let's go back to the hotel and rest up.

00:03:42.480 --> 00:03:44.320
Okay, Teacher!

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:48.100
All right, let's sing "Fri-fri-friend" all the way there!

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:48.800
Okay!

00:03:48.800 --> 00:03:49.900
One, two.

00:03:49.900 --> 00:03:54.060
Ha-ha-happy! Yes, yes, yes!

00:04:04.170 --> 00:04:08.210
Ice-ice-ice cream! Yes, yes, yes!

00:04:08.210 --> 00:04:12.080
Bull-bull-bulldog! Go, go, go, get!

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:16.390
Samu-samu-samurai friend!
Yeah, yeah, yeah, boom!

00:04:16.390 --> 00:04:17.610
Marco!

00:04:22.600 --> 00:04:24.340
The train is departing!

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:52.610
You must be tired, Your Majesty.

00:04:53.690 --> 00:04:56.680
Diplomacy is not an easy task.

00:04:56.680 --> 00:05:00.860
But I'm glad to have spent the
weekend with my grandchildren...

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:02.840
and that female tutor, too.

00:05:02.840 --> 00:05:04.260
Maria?

00:05:04.260 --> 00:05:06.010
She's just filling in until autumn,

00:05:06.010 --> 00:05:07.550
but she's doing well.

00:05:07.550 --> 00:05:08.450
Yes.

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:11.510
If my daughter had her resourcefulness...

00:05:12.030 --> 00:05:15.180
Your Majesty, that matter is already...

00:05:15.890 --> 00:05:19.670
She married into the Schmeit family.

00:05:20.120 --> 00:05:23.400
It's impossible. My father won't listen.

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:27.480
The crown prince died in a car accident some time ago.

00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:28.220
Yes.

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:31.280
Since then, all my father has done is mourn him.

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:33.790
You are the future princess.

00:05:34.040 --> 00:05:35.610
And I will be...

00:05:35.610 --> 00:05:37.250
No, that's incorrect.

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:40.790
The son my brother left behind, Marco, is the successor.

00:05:41.210 --> 00:05:44.370
He's still just a child. He can't
possibly govern this country.

00:05:44.370 --> 00:05:46.800
This time, it will be our turn.

00:05:46.800 --> 00:05:49.660
My father is the one who will decide that.

00:05:49.810 --> 00:05:54.430
You said you didn't want to babysit those three.

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:57.560
Hey Grace, look at them!

00:05:58.060 --> 00:05:59.400
They're pretty!

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:00.920
Prima donnas!

00:06:02.970 --> 00:06:04.080
Just like Mama...

00:06:04.080 --> 00:06:04.800
Grace!

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:06.640
Mama's not here anymore.

00:06:06.640 --> 00:06:09.030
B-But Louise...

00:06:09.030 --> 00:06:09.770
Come on.

00:06:09.770 --> 00:06:11.290
You promised not to cry.

00:06:11.290 --> 00:06:14.790
Ice-ice-ice cream! Yes, yes, yes!

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:17.250
Sis, I brought you some ice cream!

00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:19.620
Marco, watch out!

00:06:22.620 --> 00:06:25.170
Hey, what are you doing?

00:06:36.240 --> 00:06:38.080
Sa-sa-samurai friend.

00:06:42.650 --> 00:06:43.610
Sweet!

00:06:48.700 --> 00:06:50.320
What's wrong, children?

00:07:03.670 --> 00:07:07.340
That boy, Marco, really likes samurai.

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:10.890
He even liked the woodblock prints in the Louvre.

00:07:10.890 --> 00:07:12.010
Sweet.

00:07:12.010 --> 00:07:13.340
I'm sorry.

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:15.130
Let me ask you something.

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:18.600
Who is this "samurai friend" he sang of?

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:22.350
It's a song they like.

00:07:22.660 --> 00:07:24.360
A "samurai friend" is...

00:07:24.360 --> 00:07:27.360
a companion, you could say.

00:07:27.900 --> 00:07:29.860
A "friend" is a companion?

00:07:30.310 --> 00:07:31.990
So you must be their mother.

00:07:32.320 --> 00:07:35.770
Oh, no. I'm just their tutor.

00:07:35.770 --> 00:07:39.370
Their parents died three years ago in an accident.

00:07:41.820 --> 00:07:43.760
I'm Maria. Nice to meet you.

00:07:44.160 --> 00:07:44.880
What's your name?

00:07:46.060 --> 00:07:47.730
My name is...

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:49.630
I brought you some tea, samurai friend!

00:07:51.520 --> 00:07:52.850
Your name is Marco, right?

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:55.640
If you're a man, don't cry over something like ice cream.

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:57.100
Got it?

00:07:57.920 --> 00:07:59.430
It's a man's promise.

00:07:59.880 --> 00:08:01.890
Right. A man's promise!

00:08:02.410 --> 00:08:04.270
Why didn't we realize...

00:08:04.270 --> 00:08:06.560
...there was a samurai here all this time?

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:09.750
So who are you?

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:29.460
How cool!

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:32.140
It's a bunny!

00:08:32.140 --> 00:08:33.890
It's the rabbit on the full moon.

00:08:33.890 --> 00:08:35.160
A Japanese custom.

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:38.720
My name is Ishikawa Goemon.

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:40.140
I'm a traveling performer.

00:08:45.640 --> 00:08:46.910
That's wonderful.

00:08:52.960 --> 00:08:53.990
Mr. Ishikawa.

00:08:57.970 --> 00:08:58.910
Hey, hey!

00:08:58.910 --> 00:08:59.890
Marco!

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:03.780
What's that?

00:09:06.710 --> 00:09:08.670
Schmeit as the successor?

00:09:09.710 --> 00:09:11.800
Marco is the successor.

00:09:12.430 --> 00:09:14.740
Your Majesty, you mustn't look at that.

00:09:16.170 --> 00:09:19.550
I will protect the country until Marco comes of age.

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:22.180
He mustn't look at it?

00:09:23.110 --> 00:09:25.540
I certainly cut something worthless.

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:32.570
I was captured by a woman's charm.

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:52.900
I will now cut you down.

00:09:54.060 --> 00:09:56.100
Grandpa!

00:09:56.830 --> 00:09:57.510
What is it?

00:09:57.510 --> 00:09:59.030
Are you done looking around?

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:04.120
I will at least show him the
courtesy of waiting until he is alone.

00:10:09.870 --> 00:10:10.650
That won't stop me!

00:10:13.130 --> 00:10:14.150
What was that?

00:10:21.620 --> 00:10:23.640
Oh, Mr. Samurai?

00:10:33.530 --> 00:10:34.800
Hey...

00:10:35.640 --> 00:10:39.110
In Japan, are there still samurai like you—

00:10:39.110 --> 00:10:39.930
Nay.

00:10:40.520 --> 00:10:43.550
Samurai no longer have any place in Japan.

00:10:45.420 --> 00:10:47.400
Is that why you're traveling?

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:49.310
Perhaps.

00:10:49.990 --> 00:10:51.180
But I...

00:10:51.180 --> 00:10:52.770
Everyone's the same.

00:10:53.630 --> 00:10:55.980
No one has a place in this world.

00:10:55.980 --> 00:10:57.000
Me neither.

00:10:57.420 --> 00:10:59.320
But you have those children.

00:10:59.320 --> 00:11:00.850
You have friends.

00:11:02.020 --> 00:11:03.570
Right, a "friend".

00:11:05.410 --> 00:11:09.880
But I'm just a simple substitute tutor.

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:13.890
Well, good night.

00:11:13.890 --> 00:11:15.540
Mr. Samurai Friend.

00:11:19.030 --> 00:11:20.310
She's lovely.

00:11:24.760 --> 00:11:27.320
He's not just a street performer.

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:41.150
Train departing!

00:11:53.930 --> 00:11:56.390
Goodbye, King Tranc...

00:11:56.390 --> 00:11:58.300
and Mr. Ishikawa.

00:12:15.240 --> 00:12:16.110
What the...?

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:18.860
St-Stop!

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:22.970
E-Emergency message!

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:24.730
The train is out of control!

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:33.980
It's not working. We can't get through.

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:35.500
Your Majesty.

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:39.070
The train's going to derail if nothing is done.

00:12:42.330 --> 00:12:44.610
Grandpa!

00:12:45.420 --> 00:12:46.890
What's happening?

00:12:47.330 --> 00:12:49.390
I'm sorry, children.

00:12:50.150 --> 00:12:51.710
It's sabotage.

00:12:52.240 --> 00:12:54.550
Someone attacked the driver.

00:12:55.700 --> 00:12:57.650
You should already know who it is.

00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:00.020
Mr. Samurai!

00:13:00.910 --> 00:13:02.230
What do you mean?

00:13:02.230 --> 00:13:03.870
What would a performer like you know?

00:13:03.870 --> 00:13:04.730
Return to your seat!

00:13:10.410 --> 00:13:11.680
He's good!

00:13:14.970 --> 00:13:16.560
Drop your sword.

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:21.000
I don't care. Shoot!

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:22.400
Stop it!

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:23.210
Samurai friend!

00:13:47.950 --> 00:13:51.410
There is nothing that my sword
Zantetsuken cannot cut.

00:13:52.230 --> 00:13:54.290
C-Cool...

00:13:54.990 --> 00:13:56.040
Who are you?

00:13:56.620 --> 00:13:58.860
My name is Ishikawa Goemon.

00:13:59.290 --> 00:14:02.040
I came to take your life.

00:14:02.670 --> 00:14:04.920
So you pretended to be a street performer?

00:14:04.920 --> 00:14:06.550
Are you the saboteur?

00:14:06.850 --> 00:14:07.620
Nay.

00:14:07.970 --> 00:14:10.430
I did not desire this state of affairs.

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:13.470
I will listen to what you have to say.

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:15.720
Your Majesty!

00:14:15.720 --> 00:14:19.460
Ms. Maria, evacuate with the
children and passengers.

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:20.660
Go to the last compartment.

00:14:20.660 --> 00:14:21.230
Yes, sir.

00:14:22.390 --> 00:14:23.870
Come, let's go.

00:14:24.680 --> 00:14:26.920
This is all due to my lack of skill.

00:14:28.330 --> 00:14:29.010
Ishikawa—

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:29.960
I'm sorry.

00:14:37.580 --> 00:14:38.510
Are you all right?

00:14:38.510 --> 00:14:41.830
Teacher, Marco said he's going to save Papa's art!

00:14:42.290 --> 00:14:44.870
Okay. You two go ahead!

00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:47.480
So it's an assassination after all.

00:14:47.710 --> 00:14:50.780
It's because they did not trust my abilities.

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:53.970
No, it must have been a part
of his plan from the start.

00:14:54.740 --> 00:14:57.960
That's the kind of man he is.

00:14:59.470 --> 00:15:02.760
Since they were after my life as well,

00:15:02.760 --> 00:15:04.750
I am under no obligation to kill you.

00:15:05.330 --> 00:15:08.660
Let me take responsibility for this situation.

00:15:11.190 --> 00:15:12.010
Ms. Maria.

00:15:12.400 --> 00:15:13.420
What's the matter?

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:15.630
Marco's in the freight car!

00:15:18.490 --> 00:15:20.930
Papa's samurai...

00:15:21.410 --> 00:15:22.400
Marco!

00:15:22.790 --> 00:15:24.970
Ms. Maria!

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:27.850
<i>We only have one chance.</i>

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:32.780
<i>In order for us to slow our acceleration, we must discard the freight train. It's too heavy.</i>

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:35.160
<i>But the national treasures are in that car!</i>

00:15:35.390 --> 00:15:38.160
<i>What's more important, them or the children's lives?</i>

00:15:39.190 --> 00:15:40.550
It doesn't matter anymore.

00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:42.670
Let's go, Marco.

00:15:43.900 --> 00:15:46.360
Teacher, you're so cool.

00:15:50.520 --> 00:15:52.050
Grandpa!

00:15:52.440 --> 00:15:53.250
Marco!

00:15:53.250 --> 00:15:55.260
Come on. Let's hurry!

00:15:59.120 --> 00:16:00.580
Ms. Maria!

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:02.020
Don't worry.

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:04.300
Our samurai friend will save us.

00:16:04.300 --> 00:16:06.140
I won't cry! I promised!

00:16:06.140 --> 00:16:07.720
Well said, Marco.

00:16:07.720 --> 00:16:09.370
Ms. Maria, hurry!

00:16:09.370 --> 00:16:10.320
Right.

00:16:10.680 --> 00:16:12.480
I'll strap in the children.

00:16:12.480 --> 00:16:14.030
Give me your belts.

00:16:18.530 --> 00:16:19.950
It won't reach!

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:21.540
Ms. Maria.

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:23.590
Use my belt.

00:16:33.240 --> 00:16:34.540
Now, the brakes!

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:46.300
I cut something worthless again.

00:17:09.600 --> 00:17:12.980
Oh, jeez. There goes all the world's treasures.

00:17:12.980 --> 00:17:16.580
Ice-ice-ice cream! Yes, yes, yes!

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:20.020
Bull-bull-bulldog! Go, go, go, get!

00:17:20.020 --> 00:17:23.560
Samu-samu-samu-samurai friend!

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:25.460
Everyone come together!

00:17:25.460 --> 00:17:27.340
We have so many friends!

00:17:27.340 --> 00:17:31.000
Fri-fri-friend!

00:17:31.890 --> 00:17:33.380
You saved us.

00:17:33.380 --> 00:17:34.620
I thank you.

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:36.020
No need for thanks.

00:17:36.020 --> 00:17:38.900
I live in the shadow of solitude. Farewell.

00:17:40.100 --> 00:17:40.870
Wait.

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:44.370
Say a few words to Marco and the others.

00:17:44.630 --> 00:17:47.200
Some day, we shall be friends.

00:17:48.130 --> 00:17:49.030
I'm sorry.

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:53.040
Grace, Louise, Marco!

00:17:53.040 --> 00:17:54.080
Grandpa!

00:17:54.080 --> 00:17:56.220
Come on, let's go back to the palace!

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:04.730
Father! I'm glad everyone is okay.

00:18:15.950 --> 00:18:17.740
Hm? What's that?

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:27.160
Mr. Ishikawa.

00:18:27.740 --> 00:18:30.250
What's the meaning of this?

00:18:30.660 --> 00:18:33.000
The Baron knows.

00:18:33.830 --> 00:18:36.010
I'm sorry. I failed.

00:18:36.420 --> 00:18:38.940
I ask that you accompany me, Baron Schmeit.

00:18:46.630 --> 00:18:48.730
Good night, children.

00:18:50.570 --> 00:18:53.650
Samurai friend.

00:18:55.130 --> 00:18:58.710
Marco, become a great king.

00:19:10.630 --> 00:19:12.380
How long have you been there?

00:19:12.700 --> 00:19:14.900
Are you the same as me?

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:17.780
I suppose so, Mr. Samurai Friend.

00:19:17.780 --> 00:19:19.400
So you're an assassin, after all.

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:21.160
Or a thief.

00:19:22.050 --> 00:19:24.450
The treasures were all destroyed in the fire.

00:19:24.450 --> 00:19:26.640
It feels like this was a waste of time.

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:29.190
But the children were saved,

00:19:29.190 --> 00:19:30.390
thanks to you.

00:19:31.510 --> 00:19:32.980
You give me too much credit.

00:19:32.980 --> 00:19:34.270
It's not in my character.

00:19:36.850 --> 00:19:38.350
What are you?

00:19:38.350 --> 00:19:39.360
Give me your name.

00:19:46.210 --> 00:19:49.410
What am I? Just a woman.

00:19:51.310 --> 00:19:52.420
Beautiful...

00:19:53.980 --> 00:19:54.920
Right?

00:19:55.530 --> 00:19:58.670
This belt has been passed down in the royal family for generations.

00:19:58.670 --> 00:20:05.460
It's the "The King's Prayer", said to have been secretly sent by Auguste Rodin to his lover, Camille Claudel.

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:09.840
So that's what you were after from the start?

00:20:10.200 --> 00:20:10.950
Yes.

00:20:10.950 --> 00:20:12.770
It was all an act.

00:20:12.770 --> 00:20:14.680
Well? Are you shocked?

00:20:14.680 --> 00:20:16.370
But that goes for the both of us.

00:20:16.370 --> 00:20:17.320
This is part of the job.

00:20:17.560 --> 00:20:20.070
Nay, rather, I understand now.

00:20:21.580 --> 00:20:25.570
Well, you said that you don't have a place either.

00:20:26.010 --> 00:20:28.950
What's more, you don't have any real "friends."

00:20:28.950 --> 00:20:31.650
But I could be a real...

00:20:34.760 --> 00:20:37.430
"But I could be a real" what?

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:42.200
Mine Fujiko.

00:20:42.200 --> 00:20:43.670
Let's meet again.

00:20:43.670 --> 00:20:45.780
Mr. Wonderful Samurai Friend.

00:20:50.110 --> 00:20:52.750
Did I just get a real girlfriend?

00:20:53.950 --> 00:20:56.040
Bye bye, Goemon!

00:20:58.990 --> 00:21:01.530
Mine Fujiko.

00:21:02.450 --> 00:21:03.500
Who's there?!

00:21:04.390 --> 00:21:04.990
Shoot him!

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:16.380
Once more, I cut something worthless.
